      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanka amabizo ezizwe. Kusukela ngasemngceleni ongasenyakatho, kusukela olwandle ngendlela yeHethiloni ngasekungeneni kweHamathi, kuze kufike eHazariEnoni, elingasemngceleni wasenyakatho kweDamaseko maqondana leHamathi, ngitsho kusukela empumalanga kusiya entshonalanga, uDani uzakuba lesigaba esisodwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuxhuma endaweni kaDani, kusukela empumalanga kusiya entshonalanga uAsheri uzakuba lesigaba esisodwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuxhuma endaweni kaAsheri, kusukela empumalanga kusiya entshonalanga uNafitali uzakuba lesigaba esisodwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuxhuma endaweni kaNafitali, kusukela empumalanga kusiya entshonalanga uManase uzakuba lesigaba esisodwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuxhuma endaweni kaManase, kusukela empumalanga kusiya entshonalanga uEfrayimi uzakuba lesigaba esisodwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuxhuma endaweni kaEfrayimi, kusukela empumalanga kusiya entshonalanga uRubeni uzakuba lesigaba esisodwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuxhuma endaweni kaRubeni, kusukela empumalanga kusiya entshonalanga uJuda uzakuba lesigaba esisodwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuxhuma endaweni kaJuda, kusukela empumalanga kusiya entshonalanga kuzakuba yisigaba elizakusahlukanisela iNkosi, ububanzi baso bube zingalo eziyizinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili lanhlanu, ubude baso buzalingana lobesinye sezigaba zezizwe, kusukela empumalanga kusiya entshonalanga indlu engcwele izakuba phakathi kwaso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isigaba elizakusahlukanisela iNkosi ubude baso bube zingalo eziyizinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili lanhlanu, lobubanzi baso bube zingalo eziyizinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanzi izabelo zezigaba ezingcwele. Abapristi bazakuba lesabelo esiyizingalo ezizinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili lanhlanu ngasenyakatho; ububanzi baso ngasentshonalanga bube zingalo ezizinkulungwane ezilitshumi, lobubanzi baso ngasempumalanga bube zingalo ezizinkulungwane ezilitshumi, lobude baso ngaseningizimu bube zingalo ezizinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili lanhlanu, indlu engcwele yeNkosi izakuba phakathi kwaso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lesi sizakuba ngesabapristi abahlukaniselwa iNkosi, amadodana kaZadoki, abangikhonzayo abangaduhanga lapho abakoIsrayeli beduha njengokwenza kwamaLevi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuzakuba yisigaba sabo esikhethiweyo sivela esigabeni esingcwele selizwe, sibe yindawo engcwele kakhulu, sixhume endaweni yamaLevi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eceleni kwendawo yabapristi amaLevi azakuba lesabelo, ubude baso bube zingalo eziyizinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili lanhlanu, lobubanzi baso bube zingalo eziyizinkulungwane ezilitshumi. Ubude baso bonke buzakuba zingalo eziyizinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili lanhlanu, lobubanzi baso bube zingalo eziyizinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabayikusithengisa, loba benanise ngaso, kabayikusinika abanye lesisigaba esihle selizwe, ngoba singcwele eNkosini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indawo eseleyo, ububanzi bayo buzingalo ezizinkulungwane ezinhlanu, lobude bayo buzingalo ezizinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili lanhlanu, izasetshenziswa ngumuzi, ibe yindawo yokwakha, leganga. Phakathi kwayo kuzakuba khona umuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanzi izilinganiso zawo; ngasenyakatho uzakuba zingalo ezizinkulungwane ezine lamakhulu amahlanu, ngaseningizimu ube zingalo ezizinkulungwane ezine lamakhulu amahlanu, ngasempumalanga ube zingalo ezizinkulungwane ezine lamakhulu amahlanu, langasentshonalanga ube zingalo ezizinkulungwane ezine lamakhulu amahlanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuzi uzakuba lamadlelo, ngasenyakatho abe zingalo ezingamakhulu amabili lamatshumi amahlanu, ngaseningizimu abe zingalo ezingamakhulu amabili lamatshumi amahlanu, ngasempumalanga abe zingalo ezingamakhulu amabili lamatshumi amahlanu, langasentshonalanga abe zingalo ezingamakhulu amabili lamatshumi amahlanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indawo eseleyo eceleni lesabelo esingcwele izakuba zingalo ezizinkulungwane ezilitshumi kusiya empumalanga, ibe zingalo ezizinkulungwane ezilitshumi kusiya entshonalanga, ibe seceleni kwesabelo esingcwele. Izithelo zayo zizakuba ngezokudliwa yizisebenzi zomuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izisebenzi zomuzi ezivela kuzo zonke izizwe zakoIsrayeli zizakuyilima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isabelo sonke elizakusahlukanisa sizakuba zingalo ezizinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili lanhlanu inxa zonke, ngitsho isabelo esingcwele ndawonye lempahla yonke yomuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuseleyo inxa zonke zesigaba esingcwele lenxa zonke zempahla zomuzi kuzakuba ngokwesikhulu. Kusukela ezingalweni ezizinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili lanhlanu zesigaba esingcwele ngasempumalanga komngcele, kusiya entshonalanga kusukela ezingalweni ezizinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili kusiya emngceleni wasempumalanga, kulinganisene lezigaba zezizwe, kuzakuba ngokwesikhulu. Isigaba esingcwele kanye lendawo engcwele yethempeli phakathi kwaso, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lempahla yamaLevi lempahla yomuzi kuzakuba phakathi kwendawo yesikhulu. Isigaba sesikhulu sizakuba phakathi kwelizwe lakoJuda lakoBenjamini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izizwe eziseleyo, kusukela empumalanga kusiya entshonalanga uBenjamini uzakuba lesigaba esisodwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuxhuma endaweni kaBenjamini kusukela empumalanga kusiya entshonalanga uSimeyoni uzakuba lesigaba esisodwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuxhuma endaweni kaSimeyoni kusukela empumalanga kusiya entshonalanga uIsakari uzakuba lesigaba esisodwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuxhuma endaweni kaIsakari kusukela empumalanga kusiya entshonalanga uZebuluni uzakuba lesigaba esisodwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuxhuma endaweni kaZebuluni kusukela empumalanga kusiya entshonalanga uGadi uzakuba lesigaba esisodwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuxhuma endaweni kaGadi kusiya eningizimu, umngcele uzasuka eTamari usiya emanzini aseMeribathi‐Kadeshi, usuke lapho uhambe ngasemfuleni waseGibithe uye ngasoLwandle olukhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yiloke ilizwe elizakulaba libe ngelenu phakathi kwezizwe zakoIsrayeli, yizo izigaba zabo, kutsho iNkosi uNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
